@patternMatchmaking_JunliaAndMateo
  +setConversationGroup(Junlia, Mateo)
  +:patternMatchmaking_Table2_SetupConv()
  +panCameraToFitCharacters(1000, false, Junlia, Mateo)
  +:patternMatchmaking_pairingCount(Junlia, Mateo)
  +?eq(tmp.pairingCount, 1):{
    +:leach(Junlia, Mateo)
    Junlia: "I don't much care for flowers.  I mean they're nice and all, but I don't like the smell."
    Junlia: "But if somebody did get me flowers I wouldn't be mad.  How could I?  That would be so rude."
    Junlia: "I'd probably just put them in a vase and then give them to somebody else."
    Junlia: "Although maybe it would be good to put the flowers in a garden somewhere."
    Junlia: "I saw the most beautiful garden in a greenhouse once.  The best part was it was in the winter time!  Crazy!"
    Mateo: "<cascade-letters color=LIGHTGREY>Can you hear me?"
    +?func(inParty, Anjana):{
      +:leach(Anjana, Ada)
      Anjana: "She's still basically talking to herself."
    }
    +:ld(Ada, down)
  }
  +?eq(tmp.pairingCount, 2):{
    +:leach(Junlia, Mateo)
    Junlia: "What do you think about sand?  It's course, rough, and irritating, and it gets everywhere."
    Junlia: "Where did it all come from?  There's so much of it!"
    +?func(inParty, Anjana):{
      +:bored(Anjana)
      +:la(Anjana, Ada)
      Anjana: "Tell me why you wanted to pair them up again?"
    }
  }
  +:patternMatchmaking_Table2_EndConvo()

@patternMatchmaking_JunliaAndJack
  +setConversationGroup(Junlia, Jack)
  +:patternMatchmaking_Table2_SetupConv()
  +panCameraToFitCharacters(1000, false, Junlia, Jack)
  +:patternMatchmaking_pairingCount(Junlia, Jack)
  +?eq(tmp.pairingCount, 1):{
    +:leach(Junlia, Jack)
    Junlia: "What's your favorite holiday?  Mine is paper bag day!  It's so funny, you're supposed to wear paper bags on your head the whole day."
    +:ld(Junlia, down)
    Junlia: "I mean, I don't do it, but I think it's funny that other people do."
    +:ld(Junlia, right)
    Junlia: "Putting a bag on your head for that long seems like it would be really uncomfortable."
    +:flat(Jack)
    Jack: "<color=LIGHTGREY />(Could she be more self-absorbed?)"
    +:leach(Junlia, Jack)
  }
  +?eq(tmp.pairingCount, 2):{
    +:leach(Junlia, Jack)
    Junlia: "I don't really like music.  Unless it's classical.  Or maybe like old jazz.  Or maybe like some pop music."
    Junlia: "But I don't like it when it's too loud.  Or too quiet.  Or too fast.  Or too slow."
    Jack: "<color=LIGHTGREY />(I wonder what it's like to be her?  To be so... awful?)"
  }
  +:patternMatchmaking_Table2_EndConvo()

@patternMatchmaking_JunliaAndRandy
  +setConversationGroup(Junlia, Randy)
  +:patternMatchmaking_Table2_SetupConv()
  +panCameraToFitCharacters(1000, false, Junlia, Randy)
  +:patternMatchmaking_pairingCount(Junlia, Randy)
  +?eq(tmp.pairingCount, 1):{
    +:leach(Junlia, Randy)
    Randy: "Um hi.  I'm <color=LIGHTBLUE>Randy</>."
    Junlia: "I have this thing where I get older but I just not that wiser."
    Junlia: "Like, I stay up all night and wake up late still, you know."
    Randy: "<cascade-letters>Haha yeah.  Me too."
    Junlia: "Sometimes I like to read when it's that late.  Usually I read Romeo and Juliet.  I've read it like six million times!"
    Randy: "<cascade-letters>Haha yeah.  That sure is a lot."
    Junlia: "I like to eat too, when I'm reading.  But if I'm eating something sticky sometimes I have to put the book down with my hand and shake it off."
    Randy: "<cascade-letters>Haha yeah.  I do that too."
    +?func(inParty, Anjana):{
      +:flat(Anjana)
      +:la(Anjana, Ada)
      Anjana: "This is truly awful."
    }
    +:leach(Junlia, Randy)
  }
  +?eq(tmp.pairingCount, 2):{
    +:leach(Junlia, Randy)
    Junlia: "I like to watch movies.  But I don't like to watch them in the theater.  I like to watch them at home."
    Randy: "<cascade-letters>Haha yeah.  Me too."
    +?func(inParty, Skye):{
      +:la(Skye, Ada)
      Skye: "If I poke him, do you think he'll respond differently."
    }
  }
  +:patternMatchmaking_Table2_EndConvo()

@patternMatchmaking_JunliaAndScott
  +setConversationGroup(Junlia, Scott)
  +:patternMatchmaking_Table2_SetupConv()
  +panCameraToFitCharacters(1000, false, Junlia, Scott)
  +:patternMatchmaking_pairingCount(Junlia, Scott)
  +?eq(tmp.pairingCount, 1):{
    +:leach(Junlia, Scott)
    +:shakeZ(Junlia)
    Junlia: "So I'm totally down to go to theme parks, you know, but I'm terrified of anything that goes upside down."
    Junlia: "I just can't do it.  I'm sorry.  I just can't."
    Junlia: "And merry-go-rounds?  Forget about it.  Way too romantic.  Too much pressure."
    Junlia: "I'm just not ready for that kind of commitment."
    Scott: "Uh, okay."
    +:shakeZ(Junlia)
    Junlia: "Have you ever had one of those chili dogs with the cheese and the onions and the mustard?  They sell them at theme parks a lot."
    Junlia: "Like, you really need to try it with peanut butter if you can.  Soooo good."
    Junlia: "I mean, I know it sounds weird, but it's really good."
    Junlia: "But sometimes I don't ask for it because the vendor looks scary.  You know the type.  Like they don't like grape juice or something."
    +:question(Scott)
    Scott: "Are you... talking to me?"
    +:ld(Junlia, down)
    Junlia: "But I mean I don't like that stuff much either."
    +:la(Junlia, Scott)
    Junlia: "When I was a kid my brother gave me purple chalk water and told me it was grape juice."
    Junlia: "Totally scarred me for life.  I won't even touch wine now."
    +:ld(Scott, down)
    Scott: "Alright, then.  I'll just continue to look out for my friend."
    +none()
    +panCameraBackToPlayer()
    +:ld(Ada, down)
    +?func(inParty, Anjana):{
      +:leach(Anjana, Ada)
      Anjana: "Fascinating.  It's like nothing has changed."
      Anjana: "She's still basically talking to herself."
    }
  }
  +?eq(tmp.pairingCount, 2):{
    Junlia: "Did you know there's no way a bee should be able to fly, based on all known laws of aviation?"
    Junlia: "But the bee doesn't care what humans think is impossible.  It just flies anyway."
    +?func(inParty, Anjana):{
      +:bored(Anjana)
      +:la(Anjana, Ada)
      Anjana: "Tell me why you wanted to pair them up again?"
    }
  }
  +:patternMatchmaking_Table2_EndConvo()

@patternMatchmaking_JunliaAndLars
  +setConversationGroup(Junlia, Lars)
  +:patternMatchmaking_Table2_SetupConv()
  +panCameraToFitCharacters(1000, false, Junlia, Lars)
  +:patternMatchmaking_pairingCount(Junlia, Lars)
  +?eq(tmp.pairingCount, 1):{
    +:leach(Junlia, Lars)
    Junlia: "I'm not really a fan of the color green.  I mean, it's okay, but I don't like it when it's on me."
    Junlia: "I think it's because I have green eyes.  There's probably something scientific about that."
    Junlia: "Maybe it would look different if I wore different color contacts?  I don't know, I've never tried."
    Junlia: "Contacts really dry out my eyes.  But I guess they do for everybody else, too."
    +:leach(Lars, Ada)
    +:shakeZ(Lars)
    Lars: "Pardon.  I have question."
    Lars: "Can you translate what she is saying?  I am having difficulty understanding."
    Ada: "To be honest, I am having trouble keeping up myself."
    +?func(inParty, Skye):{
      +:leach(Skye, Anjana)
      Anjana: "It's mostly nonsense anyway."
    }
    Lars: "Oh..."
    +:leach(Junlia, Lars)
    +:ld(Ada, down)
    +panCameraBackToPlayer()
  }
  +?eq(tmp.pairingCount, 2):{
    +:leach(Ada, Lars)
    Lars: "I am still not understanding her very well..."
    +:leach(Junlia, Lars)
  }
  +:patternMatchmaking_Table2_EndConvo()

@patternMatchmaking_JunliaAndMordred
  +setConversationGroup(Junlia, Mordred)
  +:patternMatchmaking_Table2_SetupConv()
  +panCameraToFitCharacters(1000, false, Junlia, Mordred)
  +:patternMatchmaking_pairingCount(Junlia, Mordred)
  +?eq(tmp.pairingCount, 1):{
    Junlia: "You know how like everybody likes the metric system and hates imperial?  Like why?  Isn't that constricting yourself to base-ten thinking?"
    Junlia: "Binary computers might like a different system that's more like base-two.  Nobody asked them!"
    Junlia: "Heck, even base-sixteen would be preferable, probably."
    Junlia: "I'm just saying, belittling the imperial system is just as narrow minded as using the metric system in the first place."
    +:leach(Ada, Mordred)
    Mordred: "This lovely patron would do quite well with the silent monks of the abbey by the castle."
    Mordred: "They particularly enjoy this sort of philosophical-mathematical debate."
    Mordred: "Although, they typically read about them more than engage in them..."
    +:leach(Junlia, Mordred)
  }
  +?eq(tmp.pairingCount, 2):{
    +:leach(Ada, Mordred)
    Mordred: "My partner is quite interesting, but I do wish to experience others in this room."
    +:leach(Junlia, Mordred)
  }
  +:patternMatchmaking_Table2_EndConvo()

@patternMatchmaking_JunliaAndBobby
  +setConversationGroup(Junlia, Bobby)
  +:patternMatchmaking_Table2_SetupConv()
  +panCameraToFitCharacters(1000, false, Junlia, Bobby)
  +:patternMatchmaking_pairingCount(Junlia, Bobby)
  +?eq(tmp.pairingCount, 1):{
    +:leach(Junlia, Bobby)
    +:heart(Junlia)
    Junlia: "Omigawd do you have ramen?!  I love ramen!  I could eat ramen every day!"
    Bobby: "Really? Me too!  I've been trying to figure out somebody to share this with."
    Junlia: "Would you... um... consider sharing that with me?"
    +:jump(Bobby)
    Bobby: "Of course!"
    Bobby: "It's spicy though, is that okay?"
    Junlia: "The spicier the better!"
    +?func(inParty, Anjana):{
      +:leach(Ada, Anjana)
      Anjana: "I think we have a match made in heaven."
    }
    +:leach(Junlia, Bobby)
    +:ld(Ada, down)
    +panCameraBackToPlayer()
  }
  +?eq(tmp.pairingCount, 2):{
    +:leach(Junlia, Bobby)
    +:heart(Junlia)
    Junlia: "Oh, this is just the best ramen ever!  I'm so glad you shared this with me!"
    Bobby: "I'm glad you like it!  I was worried it might be too spicy."
    Junlia: "No way!  It's perfect!  I could eat this every day!"
    Bobby: "Wanna go get some more after this?"
    Junlia: "Sure!"
  }
  +:patternMatchmaking_Table2_EndConvo()